    "Name": "Banshee",
    "Details": "Quicsell's Assault PPC Support. The BNC-QS4 fires more PPC bolts than any mech you've ever seen. With a trio of our exclusive LBX PPCs, you can saturate the horizon with PPC fire, ensuring that your enemies know that you're there, but can't actually do anything about it.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Rugged</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.15</color></b>",
